{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Reach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='A warm invitation to connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for whole-person care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.'>
  <style>
    :root{
      --earth-1:#6b3f2f; /* deep clay */
      --earth-2:#a86f4d; /* terracotta */
      --leaf:#7da57d; /* sage */
      --cream:#fff8f0;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --radius:14px;
      --maxw:1100px;
      --gap:22px;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;
      color:#2b2b2b;
      background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--cream),#fff9f3 40%,#fff);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      padding:28px 18px 60px 18px;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto}
    /* header */
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--earth-1),var(--earth-2));color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--earth-1);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:0.95rem}
    nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    /* hero */
    .hero{position:relative;padding:36px;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(168,111,77,0.06),rgba(123,160,129,0.04));box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(99,67,52,0.06);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:var(--gap);align-items:center}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--earth-1);line-height:1.02}
    .hero p.lead{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);max-width:56ch}
    .hero .contact-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #fffdfa);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(107,63,47,0.06)}
    .meta{font-size:0.95rem;margin-bottom:8px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--leaf),#98b78f);color:white;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:0.85rem}
    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:8px}
    .contact-list a{color:var(--earth-2);text-decoration:none}
    /* svg backdrop */
    .bg-svg{position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-40px;width:480px;height:480px;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}
    /* sections */
    section{margin-top:26px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(107,63,47,0.04)}
    h2{margin:0 0 10px 0;color:var(--earth-1)}
    p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    ul{margin:12px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* form */
    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],input[type='tel'],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(99,67,52,0.08);font-size:0.95rem}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--earth-2),var(--earth-1));color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(107,63,47,0.08);color:var(--earth-1)}
    .muted-note{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
    /* testimonials */
    .testi{font-style:italic;color:#3e3e3e;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #fffaf7);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(107,63,47,0.04)}
    footer{margin-top:34px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem}
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .bg-svg{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <header>
      <div class='brand'>
        <div class='logo'>HM</div>
        <div>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style='font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label='main navigation'>
        <a href='index.html'>Gather</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
        <a href='conditions.html'>Concerns</a>
        <a href='approach.html'>How We Work</a>
        <a href='book.html'>Schedule</a>
        <a href='contact.html' style='font-weight:700'>Reach</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class='hero'>
        <div>
          <h1>Reach a guiding hand for whole-person care</h1>
          <p class='lead'>A calm place to start — share your concern and we will reply with thoughtful next steps. No quick fixes, only considered, integrative guidance tailored to you.</p>
          <div style='margin-top:16px'>
            <span class='pill'>Intro conversation</span>
            <span style='margin-left:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem'>Free 20-minute discovery</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class='contact-card' aria-labelledby='contact-heading'>
          <div id='contact-heading' class='meta'>Get in touch</div>
          <div class='contact-list'>
            <div><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            <div style='font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)'>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — virtual care available</div>
          </div>
          <div style='margin-top:12px'>
            <a class='btn' href='book.html'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- embedded decorative svg -->
        <svg class='bg-svg' viewBox='0 0 600 600' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
              <stop offset='0' stop-color='#a86f4d' stop-opacity='0.95'/>
              <stop offset='1' stop-color='#7da57d' stop-opacity='0.95'/>
            </linearGradient>
            <filter id='soft' x='-20%' y='-20%' width='140%' height='140%'>
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation='18' result='b'/>
            </filter>
          </defs>
          <g filter='url(#soft)'>
            <circle cx='120' cy='80' r='80' fill='url(#g1)' />
            <rect x='180' y='220' width='300' height='200' rx='40' fill='#f7efe7' />
            <path d='M420 80c-40 30-80 40-120 60s-60 60-90 80' stroke='#8a5a47' stroke-width='8' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' />
          </g>
        </svg>
      </section>

      <!-- Two column grid: process + benefits -->
      <section class='grid' aria-labelledby='how-label'>
        <div class='card'>
          <h2 id='how-label'>What happens after you reach out</h2>
          <p class='muted-note'>A gentle, structured path so your concerns are heard and explored.</p>
          <ol style='margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)'>
            <li style='margin-bottom:8px'><strong>Message received:</strong> We review the details to prepare for a focused first call.</li>
            <li style='margin-bottom:8px'><strong>Intake conversation:</strong> A guided discussion about history, lifestyle, and goals.</li>
            <li style='margin-bottom:8px'><strong>Plan formation:</strong> Personalized recommendations (nutrition, movement, mind-body, targeted labs when educationally appropriate).</li>
            <li><strong>Follow-up & support:</strong> Iterative check-ins to refine the plan. Care is a process, not a promise.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class='card'>
          <h2>How contacting helps</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Clarifies your priorities and possible next steps</li>
            <li>Connects you with an evidence-informed, whole-person perspective</li>
            <li>Outlines optional educational tests and referrals where useful</li>
            <li>Respects your pace and personal context</li>
          </ul>
          <p style='margin-top:10px' class='muted-note'>We never promise cures. Our focus is education, symptom context, and practical support.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- social proof placed after benefits to vary order -->
      <section>
        <h2>Voices from people who came seeking balance</h2>
        <div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px'>
          <div class='testi'>
            “I felt listened to for the first time in years. The plan was simple, gentle, and real.”
            <div style='margin-top:8px;font-weight:700'>— L., {{CITY}}</div>
          </div>
          <div class='testi'>
            “Practical tools I could use immediately. Follow-ups kept me on track.”
            <div style='margin-top:8px;font-weight:700'>— S., {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- contact form -->
      <section>
        <h2>Write a note — start the conversation</h2>
        <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:8px'>Tell us briefly what brings you here. You can request a discovery call or describe a concern to get a thoughtful reply.</p>

        <div style='margin-top:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:18px'>
          <div class='card'>
            <form id='contact-form'>
              <input type='text' name='name' placeholder='Your name' required />
              <input type='email' name='email' placeholder='Email' required />
              <input type='tel' name='phone' placeholder='Phone (optional)' />
              <select name='preferred' aria-label='Preferred contact'>
                <option value='email'>Prefer email</option>
                <option value='phone'>Prefer phone</option>
                <option value='call'>Request discovery call</option>
              </select>
              <textarea name='message' placeholder='A brief note about your concern or what you hope to address'></textarea>
              <label style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:6px'><input type='checkbox' name='ok' value='1' checked /> I consent to receive a reply by email or phone.</label>

              <div style='display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:8px'>
                <button class='btn' type='submit'>Send message</button>
                <button class='ghost' type='button' id='mailto-fallback'>Email directly</button>
              </div>

              <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:10px'>If you have an urgent medical concern, please call local emergency services or your primary care provider.</p>
            </form>
          </div>

          <aside class='card'>
            <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Quick ways to connect</h3>
            <p style='margin-top:6px'><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></p>
            <p style='margin-top:6px'><strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
            <hr style='margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px dashed rgba(99,67,52,0.06)' />
            <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Free guide</h4>
            <p class='muted-note'>Download a short primer on setting initial wellness goals. It's a simple, practical starting point.</p>
            <div style='margin-top:12px'>
              <form id='lead-form'>
                <input type='email' name='lead-email' placeholder='Your email' required />
                <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px'>
                  <button class='btn' type='submit'>Send guide</button>
                </div>
              </form>
              <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:8px'>We value privacy and your time. No spam.</p>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- faq -->
      <section>
        <h2>Questions people ask</h2>
        <div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px'>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>How soon can I book?</strong>
            <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:8px'>Typical availability is visible on the scheduling page. We aim to offer a discovery call within two weeks when possible.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>Do you accept insurance?</strong>
            <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:8px'>Insurance coverage varies. We can discuss billing options and receipts for reimbursement during intake.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>Are lab tests recommended?</strong>
            <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:8px'>Tests are offered as educational tools when indicated. They are optional and discussed in the context of your history.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>Is remote care available?</strong>
            <p class='muted-note' style='margin-top:8px'>Yes — many consultations are remote. Some evaluations or treatments may be best in person.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- final cta -->
      <section style='margin-top:22px;text-align:center'>
        <h2 style='margin-bottom:8px'>Ready to begin?</h2>
        <p class='muted-note' style='margin-bottom:14px'>Schedule an introductory conversation or send a message. We respond with careful, educational guidance.</p>
        <div style='display:inline-flex;gap:10px'>
          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class='ghost' href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>Email us</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} · {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} · Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div style='margin-top:6px'>These services focus on education and whole-person support; results vary and no specific cure is promised.</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Contact form handler: POSTs to the configured endpoint, falls back to mailto
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
      const fallbackBtn = document.getElementById('mailto-fallback');
      form.addEventListener('submit', async (e)=>{
        e.preventDefault();
        const data = new FormData(form);
        // Basic client-side guard
        if(!data.get('name') || !data.get('email')){
          alert('Please provide a name and email.');
          return;
        }
        try{
          const resp = await fetch('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}', {method:'POST', body: data});
          if(resp.ok){
            alert('Thank you — we will reply within a few business days.');
            form.reset();
          }else{
            fallbackMailto();
          }
        }catch(err){
          // network or CORS failure; fallback to mailto
          fallbackMailto();
        }
      });

      fallbackBtn.addEventListener('click', fallbackMailto);

      function fallbackMailto(){
        const nm = encodeURIComponent(form.querySelector('[name=name]').value || '');
        const em = encodeURIComponent(form.querySelector('[name=email]').value || '');
        const ph = encodeURIComponent(form.querySelector('[name=phone]').value || '');
        const msg = encodeURIComponent(form.querySelector('[name=message]').value || '');
        const subject = encodeURIComponent('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} inquiry from ' + (nm || em));
        const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: ')+nm+encodeURIComponent('\nEmail: ')+em+encodeURIComponent('\nPhone: ')+ph+encodeURIComponent('\n\nMessage:\n')+msg;
        window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
      }

      // simple lead magnet handler: pretend to send and show success
      const lead = document.getElementById('lead-form');
      lead.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const email = lead.querySelector('[name=lead-email]').value;
        if(!email){ alert('Please enter an email'); return; }
        // In a real build, POST to a newsletter service. Here, show a friendly notice.
        alert('Guide sent to ' + email + ' (demo).');
        lead.reset();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and guidance for the holistic_medicine site (chunk 4)

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html  — complete contact page with embedded SVG background, contact form, lead-magnet form, FAQs, testimonials, and final CTA.
- README.md     — this file.

Purpose
- This chunk provides the contact page for the Holistic / Integrative Medicine website. It follows the project voice (minimal_poetic) and warm, earthy visual language.

Placeholders to replace
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}

Notes and integration
- The contact form attempts to POST to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. For a working integration, ensure that URL accepts a multipart/form-data POST (or adapt the JS to match the endpoint API). If no endpoint is available, users can still contact via the mailto fallback which opens the default email client.
- The lead magnet form is a placeholder that currently shows a demo alert. Replace its handler with your mailing-list endpoint (Mailchimp, ConvertKit, etc.) as needed.
- An embedded decorative SVG is included inline for immediate visual richness. The CSS also includes a fallback reference to '/assets/img/pattern.svg' (if you prefer a standalone asset). To follow the design brief, consider creating a unique file at assets/img/pattern.svg and referencing it site-wide for consistent texture.

Accessibility & content guidance
- Headings and link labels were intentionally varied from other pages to satisfy uniqueness constraints while preserving clear navigation.
- The content avoids any language promising cures; it emphasizes education, whole-person assessment, and iterative care.
- Add alt text or aria labels on any additional images you include. The decorative svg is aria-hidden.

Styling and assets
- All visuals are implemented with CSS and an embedded SVG to avoid external CDNs. Colors and radii follow an 'earthy_warm' tone.
- If you add an external assets/img/pattern.svg, keep it stylistically consistent (warm gradient, organic shapes) and reference it in the global stylesheet as a background-image.

Deploy notes
- Ensure the server serving {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} includes appropriate CORS headers if you want the in-page fetch to succeed from browsers.
- Replace the placeholders before publishing.

This chunk contains only the contact page and README for chunk 4. Other site pages (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) are provided in other chunks of the project.

Design/voice cue
- Keep copy minimal, gently poetic, and practical. Maintain the no-guarantee stance in all patient-facing copy.

If you want, I can:
- produce the assets/img/pattern.svg file to match the inline SVG style
- adapt the form to a specific backend endpoint (provide details)
- localize the page for another city/state

"} 
BUNDLE_END
